{
  "id": "feature-flags-backend-lives-in-products-feature-flags-backen",
  "title": "Feature flags backend lives in products/feature_flags/backend (not posthog/models)",
  "kind": "location",
  "answers": [
    "Where is the FeatureFlag model?",
    "Where is flag caching / local evaluation code?",
    "Where do flag management commands live?"
  ],
  "body": "- No `posthog/models/feature_flag/` dir; the product is `products/feature_flags/backend/`.\n- Model: `models/feature_flag.py:FeatureFlag` (table posthog_featureflag; `filters` JSONField; `objects` hides soft-deleted, `objects_including_soft_deleted` includes them).\n- Serialized caches (HyperCache/Redis): `flags_cache.py:update_flags_cache`, `local_evaluation.py:update_flag_definitions_cache` (SDK local-eval blob).\n- Filter shape validation: `filters_validation.py:collect_filters_violations` (no version number).\n- Status/staleness: `flag_status.py:FeatureFlagStatusChecker`.\n- Actual evaluation is in Rust: `rust/feature-flags/src/flags/flag_matching.rs` (only grepped, not read).\n- Commands split: cache warm/verify in `posthog/management/commands/`; audit/repair/delete in `products/feature_flags/backend/management/commands/`.\n- Temporal health check: `products/feature_flags/backend/temporal/health_checks/stale_flags.py`.",
  "tags": [
    "feature-flags",
    "layout"
  ],
